</label>
</coordinates>

<annotations>
<annotation ref="figure" text="The rectangle R in the x y plane, with corners at the origin, 3 comma 0, 3 comma 2, and 0 comma 2, shaded gray. Its four edges are labeled L 1 along the bottom, L 2 along the right, L 3 along the top, and L 4 along the left. The critical point 1 comma 1 is marked inside the rectangle.">
